			description: ["Jade draws a tooltip for whatever block or mob is under your crosshair.", "", "It reads tank contents, energy buffers, crop growth and mob health straight", "out of the block. Every machine in this cluster reports through it.", "", "Controls -> Jade -> Open Config turns individual lines on and off."]
