			description: ["Roughly Enough Items lists every item in the pack down the right edge.", "", "Left-click an item for its recipe. RIGHT-click it for what it is used in --", "that is the half people forget, and it is how you work forwards.", "", "Type @powah to filter by mod, #ingots to filter by tag."]
