			title: "Fix The Options Screen"
			description: ["Two small mods that only matter because this pack is huge.", "", "Controlling adds a search box to Options -> Controls. Type an action name,", "or click the key field and press a key to see everything already bound to it.", "", "Mouse Tweaks: hold left-click and sweep across slots to move a row.", "Scroll the wheel over a slot to push items to the other container."]
