			title: "Read The Hunger Bar"
			description: ["AppleSkin overlays what a food will restore before you eat it.", "", "Ghost drumsticks are hunger. The darker bar behind them is SATURATION,", "which is the number that actually decides how long until you are hungry again.", "", "Held-item preview also shows on the exhaustion side, so you can see", "sprinting and swimming draining you."]
