			title: "Two Minimaps"
			description: ["You are running two mapping systems and by default they overlap.", "", "Xaero's Minimap and Xaero's World Map are one pair; FTB Chunks ships its", "own minimap and full map. Pick one minimap and disable the other.", "", "Keep FTB Chunks' map: it is the only one that draws chunk claims."]
