			id: "1F57DFA5876205B7"
			title: "Generate It Early"
			description: ["Terrain generating under you is what causes the stutter while sailing.", "Chunky builds it in advance.", "", "/chunky center 0 0 then /chunky radius 3000 then /chunky start.", "Track it with /chunky progress, stop it with /chunky pause -- it saves.", "", "It will saturate your CPU. Run it while you are not playing."]
