			description: ["Open the Claim Manager (Controls -> FTB Chunks) and left-click chunks.", "", "A claimed chunk stops other players breaking blocks or opening containers", "inside it. Your team shares the claim; allies can be let in per team.", "", "You get a fixed number of claims. Spend them on the base, not the ocean."]
