			description: ["SHIFT-click a claimed chunk in the Claim Manager to force-load it.", "", "Force-loaded chunks keep ticking when nobody is nearby. Without this every", "generator, quarry and farm in this cluster freezes the moment you sail off.", "", "Force-load allowance is far smaller than claim allowance. Cover the", "machine room, not the whole island."]
