			description: ["Simple Voice Chat is proximity audio. Bind Push to Talk under", "Options -> Controls -> Voice Chat, then open the Voice Chat Menu", "to choose your microphone and test the level.", "", "Whisper shortens your range. Groups let a crew talk across the whole", "map -- which is the only sane way to run a ship with someone up the mast."]
