			id: "8C84C5715A2B78D1"
			title: "See Past The Horizon"
			description: ["Distant Horizons renders low-detail terrain far beyond your render distance.", "On an ocean pack that is the difference between sailing blind and seeing land.", "", "Set VANILLA render distance low and DH's LOD distance high. That pairing", "is the whole point -- raising both just costs you the framerate twice.", "", "DH can only draw chunks that have been generated, so pregenerate first."]
