			description: ["Iris loads shaders. The pack ships Complementary Reimagined in", "shaderpacks/, and Euphoria Patches is installed to extend it.", "", "Options -> Video Settings -> Shader Packs.", "", "If the framerate collapses, lower the shader's own profile before you", "touch render distance. Shaders cost far more than chunks do."]
