			title: "When It Stutters"
			description: ["Sodium replaces the renderer, Lithium the server tick, ModernFix the load", "path, Entity Culling and ImmediatelyFast the draw calls. All already on.", "", "When it still stutters: F3 shows chunk updates and memory pressure.", "Sodium's own options are under Video Settings, and Reese's Sodium Options", "exposes sliders vanilla hides.", "", "Do not remove these to 'debug' a problem. They are not the problem."]
